   * 2. Compute standard deviation of each column.
   *
   * Same optimization idea: accumulate by rows (i outer, j inner)
   * so that accesses to 'data' are unit-stride in memory.  For each
   * column j, the sequence of additions over i remains in the same
   * order as in the original code.
   * ------------------------------------------------------------------*/
